---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Base
  title="Privacy — CasuallyGenerous"
  description="What personal data CasuallyGenerous collects, why, and how it's handled."
>
  <div class="wrap detail t-Planned">
    <div class="detail-top">
      <a class="back" href={base}>← Home</a>
    </div>

    <div class="detail-head">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="detail-hook">
        This page explains what personal data this site collects, why, and how
        it's handled. This is a small side project, not a company — if
        anything here is unclear or you have concerns, get in touch through
        the <a class="orglink" href={`${base}about.html`}>About</a> page.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="howto">
      <h2>What I collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>If you use the contact form: your name (optional), email address, and message</li>
        <li>If you submit a story on an activity page: your status ("did it" / "want to try"), an optional name, and an optional written story</li>
        <li>Aggregate, non-personal website analytics (pages visited, general location by country, referring site) — this data isn't linked to you individually and can't identify you</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why I collect it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Contact form data is used only to read and reply to your message</li>
        <li>Story submissions are shown publicly on the relevant activity page, since sharing what you've done is the whole point of that feature — don't submit anything in the story text you wouldn't want public</li>
        <li>Analytics helps me understand which parts of the site are useful and which aren't</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Who processes it</h2>
      <p>This site is built on a few external services, each of which processes data on my behalf:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Formspree (contact form submissions) — data is retained for 30 days, then automatically deleted</li>
        <li>Google Firebase (story submissions) — stored until I remove it</li>
        <li>Cloudflare (site analytics) — cookieless, aggregate only</li>
        <li>GitHub Pages (site hosting)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How long I keep it</h2>
      <p>
        Contact form messages are automatically deleted after 30 days by
        Formspree. Story submissions remain visible until removed — I
        periodically review these and will remove anything inappropriate, and
        will remove your submission on request.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask me to show you what I hold about you, correct it, or
        delete it, at any time, by getting in touch through the
        <a class="orglink" href={`${base}about.html`}>About</a> page.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site doesn't use tracking or advertising cookies. The analytics
        tool in use (Cloudflare) is cookieless by design.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
